gradeRuleDescribe.course_pol:
Please strictly abide by the class rules during class (no lateness, no use of mobile devices, no sleeping, no doing non-class things)!
Roll call from time to time!
Just lying down on the table is considered a violation of the "no sleep" classroom rule! 
1. Classes on time, you must not be late or leave early. When entering and leaving the classroom, you must not affect others' learning and teacher lectures.
2. Wear neatly wearing slippers;
3. Do not eat in the course room, waste paper and garbage must take the initiative to pick up and throw it into the trash;
4. Bring the handbook, textbook, work paper and stationery required;
5. Follow the teacher's instructions;
6. Respect each other with teachers and classmates, and be polite to talk. Do not fight, do not scold people, do not speak rough words, do not damage the public property;
7. Sitting posture, do not lie down, do not sit sideways, do not make noise, do not laugh, do not make trouble, do not sleep;
8. Go to the Teacher Meeting of the Prophet in the bathroom.
9. All electronic products, books, and items that are not related to the classroom, please do not take it out;
10. Study every class carefully, consciously abide by classroom discipline, and do not do things that have nothing to do with learning.

